<title>MALAYSIA: Chemical Co of Malaysia nine-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Chemical Co of Malaysia nine-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     36.2	 vs	 30.5</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    20.3	 vs	 17.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		446.9	 vs	376.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 59.6	 vs	 54.3</p>
<p>    Minorities (less)    11.1	 vs	  9.6</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries less  3.5	 vs  gain 57.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Chemical Co of Malaysia Bhd. Its businesses include making industrial chemicals and healthcare.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
